OL,3,GNEWSAPrison violence, drugs and
OL,4,Aself-harm rates 'still too high'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrug abuse and rates of self-harm at a
OL,7,FNorth West prison are still far too
OL,8,Fhigh, a watchdog has found.
OL,10,FHMP Altcourse in Fazakerley, Liverpool,
OL,11,Fhas not suceeded in reducing either
OL,12,Fsince the last previous inspection in
OL,13,FJuly, according to His Majesty's Chief
OL,14,FInspector of Prisons, Charlie Taylor.
OL,16,FHe said leaders had "responded
OL,17,Fpositively" to many of the findings
OL,18,Fsince a highly critical review in 2025,
OL,19,Fbut there was still insufficient
OL,20,Fprogress in some areas.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
