OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPrison violence, drugs and
OL,4,Aself-harm rates 'still too high'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaylor said the jail, which held 1,100
OL,7,Fmale prisoners at the time of the
OL,8,Freview, was "managing significant
OL,9,Fpopulation pressures". An HMP Altcourse
OL,10,Fspokesman said it was focused on
OL,11,F"addressing all of the areas identified
OL,12,Fby the inspectorate".
